<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait Real Estate Bank 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Kuwait Real Estate Bank 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			    (Million dinars unless stated)</p>
<p>					1996	   1995</p>
<p>Net profit			  6.319	  4.195</p>
<p>Net interest income	     8.870	  5.868</p>
<p>Loan provisions		   0.781	  0.079</p>
<p>Total dividend		    4.685	  3.124</p>
<p>Full name: Kuwait Real Estate Bank KSC</p>
<p>Note: The bank's general assembly authorised the board of directors to issue bonds with a maximum value of 60 million Kuwaiti dinars.</p>
<p>($1 = 0.304 dinar)</p>
</text>
